  m_Name: GimbalDialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  playerLines:
  - <i>A Gimbal</i>
  - <i>A support structure to facilitate the rotation of structures in 3 dimensions</i>
  - <i>First described by Philo of Byzantium in 280 to 220 BCE</i>
  - <i>Though intuitive, its chance to lock and constrain rotation makes it unreliable</i>
  - ...
  - What's the point then?
  - Looks useless
  - hmm?
  - I don't really get vectors and stuff but if you can lock up, what's the point?
  - no you're not
  NPCLines:
  - What did you just say?
  - You ignorant child
  - I am NOT obselete!
  - I am the reason you can turn your head to look at me
  - Well yeah but still
  - I will show you my worth
  - I will not let quaternions take my crown
  - Witness the Gimbal lock!
  speakTurnPlayer: 010101010101010001010000000100000000
